{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>面對考試壓力，很多學生都難以專注學習，甚至出現焦慮情緒。《Pingo》是一款以科學實證為基礎的學習夥伴，提供無廣告、無需登入、無訂閱的純淨環境，幫助你減輕考試壓力、保持專注並自信準備。目前正在限時免費，原價 US $2.99。</p>\n\n<h2>三大核心功能</h2>\n<p>首先，內建的「考前冷靜練習」引導你進行科學調節的呼吸練習，能在高壓時刻快速放鬆心情、重拾專注。其次，智能考試規劃器讓你輕鬆管理各科考試時間表，自動生成複習計劃與倒數提醒，避免臨時抱佛腳。最後，結合間隔重複的智能閃卡與蕃茄鐘專注模式，幫助你建立高效學習習慣，提升記憶效率同時避免過度疲勞。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-292-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-293-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-294-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-295-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-296-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-297-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Beat Exam Stress &amp; Study smart</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T19:19:32.139010+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}